{"step_index":183,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T05:37:41Z","content":"The **SecureChain** platform is now up and running!\n\n### 🌐 Live Server URLs\n\n* **Frontend Web Application**: [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)\n* **Backend API Service**: [http://127.0.0.1:8001](http://127.0.0.1:8001)\n* **Interactive Swagger API Documentation**: [http://127.0.0.1:8001/docs](http://127.0.0.1:8001/docs)\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Pre-Loaded Demo Environment\n\nThe database has been seeded with demo projects and security scenarios:\n1. `payment-gateway-service` (Node.js/NPM) — Contains malicious package `event-stream@3.3.6`, sabotaged `colors`, and exposed AWS API secrets in build logs.\n2. `auth-identity-service` (Python/PyPI) — Contains vulnerable Log4j/Django/aiohttp dependencies and missing SLSA provenance metadata.\n3. `company-auth-lib` — Dependency confusion target package registered on public registry.\n\nYou can view the full security workflow, trigger live security scans, verify artifact checksum hashes, and track remediations directly in your browser."}
