{"step_index":205,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:47:25Z","thinking":"**Defining Secure Development**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the initial phase deliverables. Specifically, I'm working to outline the necessary components for the Secure Development and Build Environment, with an eye toward identifying the repository structure, branch/workflow strategy, and key elements within. Five elements will need identification.\n\n\n**Defining Phase Deliverables**\n\nI've moved on to solidify the deliverables for Phase 12 and 13. I'm focusing on Secure Coding, Refactoring, and Containerized Development. For secure coding, I'm thinking about the implementation of modules, identifying and fixing security weaknesses, and demonstrating secure data handling. For containerization, I'm planning to demonstrate Docker and Kubernetes usage with relevant security practices. The plan includes the creation of artifacts, such as source code, Dockerfiles, and Kubernetes manifests.\n\nI am also making plans to revamp the React Frontend UI. I've begun reviewing the current UI files to refine them with modern glassmorphism, animations, gradient badges, and interactive components.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --bg-main: #090d16;\n    --bg-card: #111827;\n    --border-color: #1f2937;\n    --accent-glow: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15);\n  }\n\n  body {\n    @apply bg-[#090d16] text-gray-100 antialiased font-sans selection:bg-sky-500/30 selection:text-sky-200;\n  }\n\n  * {\n    @apply border-gray-800/80;\n  }\n\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n    @apply bg-[#090d16];\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n    @apply bg-gray-800 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors;\n  }\n}\n\n@layer components {\n  /* High-end glass card with hover glow */\n  .card {\n    @apply bg-gray-900/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-gray-800/80 rounded-xl p-5 \n           shadow-xl shadow-black/20 hover:border-gray-700/80 transition-all duration-200;\n  }\n\n  .card-glow {\n    @apply card relative overflow-hidden before:absolute before:inset-0 \n           before:bg-gradient-to-r before:from-sky-500/10 before:to-purple-500/10 \n           before:opacity-0 hover:before:opacity-100 before:transition-opacity before:pointer-events-none;\n  }\n\n  /* Sleek Badges */\n  .badge {\n    @apply inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase border;\n  }\n\n  .badge-critical {\n    @apply badge bg-red-950/60 text-red-400 border-red-800/60 shadow-sm shadow-red-950/50;\n  }\n  .badge-high {\n    @apply badge bg-orange-950/60 text-orange-400 border-orange-800/60 shadow-sm shadow-orange-950/50;\n  }\n  .badge-medium {\n    @apply badge bg-amber-950/60 text-amber-400 border-amber-800/60 shadow-sm shadow-amber-950/50;\n  }\n  .badge-low {\n    @apply badge bg-sky-950/60 text-sky-400 border-sky-800/60 shadow-sm shadow-sky-950/50;\n  }\n  .badge-none {\n    @apply badge bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-800/60;\n  }\n\n  /* Styled Buttons */\n  .btn-primary {\n    @apply inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 \n           bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-sky-400 hover:to-blue-500 \n           text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/25 \n           transition-all duration-150 active:scale-[0.98] disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none;\n  }\n\n  .btn-secondary {\n    @apply inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 \n           bg-gray-800/80 hover:bg-gray-700/90 text-gray-200 text-xs font-medium \n           rounded-lg border border-gray-700/80 transition-all duration-150 active:scale-[0.98];\n  }\n\n  .btn-danger {\n    @apply inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 \n           bg-red-600/90 hover:bg-red-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold \n           rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-red-600/20 transition-all duration-150 active:scale-[0.98];\n  }\n\n  /* Inputs & Selects */\n  .input {\n    @apply w-full bg-gray-950/80 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg px-3.5 py-2 text-xs \n           text-gray-100 placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 \n           focus:ring-sky-500/50 focus:border-sky-500 transition-all;\n  }\n\n  .select {\n    @apply input appearance-none cursor-pointer bg-no-repeat pr-8;\n  }\n\n  .table-row {\n    @apply border-b border-gray-800/60 hover:bg-gray-800/40 transition-colors duration-150;\n  }\n}\n","Description":"Enhanced global CSS with high-end dark styling","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\addal\\Documents\\antigravity\\focused-bell\\frontend\\src\\index.css","toolAction":"Updating index.css for UI refinement","toolSummary":"Update UI global styling"}}]}
